<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley cuts Circus Circus.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley cuts Circus Circus.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said Tuesday it cut Circus Circus Enterprises Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley also cut Mirage Resorts Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
